<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-notebook – Cli</title><link>https://go-notebook.github.io/docs/main/tags/cli/</link><description>Recent content in Cli on go-notebook</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://go-notebook.github.io/docs/main/tags/cli/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>The notebook command</title><link>https://go-notebook.github.io/docs/main/cli/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-notebook.github.io/docs/main/cli/</guid><description>
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go install github.com/go-notebook/notebook/cmd/notebook@latest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Usage:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; notebook [command]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;Available Commands:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; completion Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; help Help about any command
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; html Run the notebook and write its results as a page next to it (or --output)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; run Run the notebook and print each cell&amp;#39;s results
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; serve Run the notebook again every time it changes, showing it live in a browser
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; watch Run the notebook again every time it changes, keeping its page current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;notebook --help&lt;/code&gt; lists the verbs, &lt;code&gt;notebook &amp;lt;verb&amp;gt; --help&lt;/code&gt; the flags of one,
and &lt;code&gt;notebook --version&lt;/code&gt; the release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Edit the &lt;code&gt;.md&lt;/code&gt; in any editor. Every verb goes through the same kernel, so each
one runs only the cells whose code or inputs changed since the last run of
that notebook, whichever verb ran it (see &lt;a href="https://go-notebook.github.io/docs/main/kernel/"&gt;The kernel&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="run"&gt;run&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="run"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#run" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;notebook run analysis.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Runs the notebook and prints each code cell: its index, its line in the file,
and either how long it ran or &lt;code&gt;kept&lt;/code&gt; when its result was kept from before;
then what it printed, what it showed and its error, indented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-console" data-lang="console"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; notebook run spectrum.md
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;── cell 0 (line 4, kept)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;── cell 1 (line 12, kept)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;── cell 2 (line 19, ran in 42µs)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt; 9.54929284535666e-07
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The exit status is non-zero when a cell failed (&lt;code&gt;notebook: 1 cell(s) failed&lt;/code&gt;),
so &lt;code&gt;notebook run&lt;/code&gt; can gate a CI job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="html"&gt;html&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="html"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#html" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;notebook html analysis.md &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# writes analysis.html&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;notebook html -o report.html analysis.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Runs the notebook and writes a standalone HTML page: the prose rendered as
Markdown, each code cell with what it printed, showed or failed with. The page
has &lt;strong&gt;no scripts and no external resources&lt;/strong&gt;, and raw HTML in the prose is left
out (goldmark&amp;rsquo;s safe default), so a page made from someone else&amp;rsquo;s notebook runs
nothing of theirs but what its cells chose to display.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="watch"&gt;watch&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="watch"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#watch" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;notebook watch analysis.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Runs the notebook every time the file changes, and keeps &lt;code&gt;analysis.html&lt;/code&gt; (or
&lt;code&gt;-o&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;--output&lt;/code&gt;) current. Each run prints one line:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-console" data-lang="console"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;21:28:21 0 of 3 cells ran, build 252ms: ok
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It looks at the file&amp;rsquo;s modification time every &lt;code&gt;--interval&lt;/code&gt; (300 ms by
default), and runs until interrupted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="serve"&gt;serve&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="serve"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#serve" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;notebook serve analysis.md
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;notebook serve --addr 127.0.0.1:9000 analysis.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same loop as &lt;code&gt;watch&lt;/code&gt;, but the page is served at &lt;code&gt;--addr&lt;/code&gt; (default
&lt;code&gt;127.0.0.1:8888&lt;/code&gt;) instead of written to a file:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-console" data-lang="console"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="gp"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; notebook serve spectrum.md
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;serving spectrum.md at http://127.0.0.1:8888/
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="go"&gt;21:28:21 0 of 3 cells ran, build 252ms: ok
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The page &lt;strong&gt;reloads itself&lt;/strong&gt; through a server-sent event when the results
change, and keeps its scroll position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A notebook that cannot run at all (for example, an import that cannot be
fetched) is shown as an &lt;strong&gt;error page&lt;/strong&gt; instead of a stale one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The served page is the &lt;code&gt;html&lt;/code&gt; page plus the small script that reloads it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="flags"&gt;Flags&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="flags"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#flags" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Flag&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Default&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Verbs&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Meaning&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;-o&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--output&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;notebook&amp;gt;.html&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;html&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;watch&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;the HTML file to write&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--addr&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;127.0.0.1:8888&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;serve&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;where &lt;code&gt;serve&lt;/code&gt; listens&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--interval&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;300ms&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;watch&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;serve&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;how often the file is looked at (must be positive)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;-w&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--work&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;under the user cache directory&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;the &lt;a href="https://go-notebook.github.io/docs/main/kernel/#on-disk"&gt;work directory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--runtime-src&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;use the go-notebook source tree at this path instead of a released runtime&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;-t&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--timeout&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt; (no limit)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;stop a cell, in Go or in Ruby, that runs longer than this (&lt;code&gt;30s&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;2m&lt;/code&gt;): its worker is killed, the cell fails, and the next run starts a new worker&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;-m&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;--memory&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt; (no limit)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;stop a cell whose worker&amp;rsquo;s Go heap holds more than this many MiB: the garbage collector keeps under it as long as it can, then the worker is stopped and the cell fails&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Flags are POSIX (since v0.4.0): a long name takes two dashes, a one-letter
shorthand one (&lt;code&gt;notebook html -o out.html nb.md&lt;/code&gt;,
&lt;code&gt;notebook run --timeout 30s nb.md&lt;/code&gt;), before or after the notebook. A verb
refuses a flag it does not read. The single-dash spelling of v0.3 and earlier
(&lt;code&gt;-timeout 30s&lt;/code&gt;) is still accepted, with a note on stderr.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;NOTEBOOK_REPLACE=module=dir,module=dir&lt;/code&gt; points modules of the work module at
local checkouts, to run a notebook against a library being changed (for example
&lt;code&gt;github.com/go-scikit/ruby=../ruby&lt;/code&gt; for the Ruby bindings).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="the-work-directory"&gt;The work directory&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="the-work-directory"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#the-work-directory" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;By default each notebook has its own work directory under the user&amp;rsquo;s cache
directory (&lt;code&gt;go-notebook/&amp;lt;hash of the notebook's absolute path&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;), so a second
&lt;code&gt;notebook run&lt;/code&gt; of the same file starts where the first stopped. Pass &lt;code&gt;--work&lt;/code&gt;
to choose another, for example a fresh one to run everything again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="the-runtime-the-notebook-links"&gt;The runtime the notebook links&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="the-runtime-the-notebook-links"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#the-runtime-the-notebook-links" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compiled notebook links package &lt;code&gt;runtime&lt;/code&gt; of go-notebook. A &lt;code&gt;notebook&lt;/code&gt;
installed from a release tag makes the notebook&amp;rsquo;s work module require that same
release. A &lt;code&gt;notebook&lt;/code&gt; built from a source checkout uses that checkout instead
(through a &lt;code&gt;replace&lt;/code&gt; directive), since its pseudo-version names no published
runtime with the same code; &lt;code&gt;--runtime-src&lt;/code&gt; points at a checkout explicitly.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>